(4815355, 697069, 86447, '<td valign="top">If this were taken squared up to the door, instead of from an angle, I think it would have scored better.  I like the colors very much.</td>', 'If this were taken squared up to the door, instead of from an angle, I think it would have scored better.  I like the colors very much.', '2008-07-09 17:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815357, 696151, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think if the beautiful model had not been included, then this would fit the challenge of "weathered" better.</td>', 'I think if the beautiful model had not been included, then this would fit the challenge of "weathered" better.', '2008-07-09 17:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815359, 695264, 86447, '<td valign="top">These adorable young hands are not ''weathered'' at all, in my opinion.   <br/> <br/>The hand in the foreground being so out of focus distracts more than if it has not been included.</td>', 'These adorable young hands are not ''weathered'' at all, in my opinion.    The hand in the foreground being so out of focus distracts more than if it has not been included.', '2008-07-09 17:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815362, 696023, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish I could see this man''s eyes... they''re the ''heart'' of any portrait.   They appear to only be eyeless dark slits on my monitor.  Also, the angled background and spot of bright light on his right ear distract me.  But, I''m odd.  :)</td>', 'I wish I could see this man''s eyes... they''re the ''heart'' of any portrait.   They appear to only be eyeless dark slits on my monitor.  Also, the angled background and spot of bright light on his right ear distract me.  But, I''m odd.  :)', '2008-07-09 17:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815364, 695545, 86447, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really say ''weathered'' to me as much as perhaps a closeup of the rusty spring would have.<br/> <br/>Also, seeing the back side of the ''horse'' instead of his eye is not as pleasing to me.  Perhaps from a different angle?</td>', 'This doesn''t really say ''weathered'' to me as much as perhaps a closeup of the rusty spring would have. Also, seeing the back side of the ''horse'' instead of his eye is not as pleasing to me.  Perhaps from a different angle?', '2008-07-09 17:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
