(4815758, 696893, 92601, '<td valign="top">You could''ve brought the greens when editing. Also, It''d help if you had better lighting. Not too bad compared to other entries I''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'You could''ve brought the greens when editing. Also, It''d help if you had better lighting. Not too bad compared to other entries I''ve seen in this challenge.', '2008-07-09 20:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
