(4815772, 694542, 92601, '<td valign="top">I look at this as a simple snapshot of a damage window frame, not a "artistic" photo. Try finding better subjects.</td>', 'I look at this as a simple snapshot of a damage window frame, not a "artistic" photo. Try finding better subjects.', '2008-07-09 20:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
