(4815787, 695768, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the tones.  Not too sure about the point of view - maybe a little lower...</td>', 'I like the composition and the tones.  Not too sure about the point of view - maybe a little lower...', '2008-07-09 20:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
