(4815791, 696995, 34192, '<td valign="top">wow.  When this opened, that''s all that came out of my mouth.  Beautiful - what else can I say?</td>', 'wow.  When this opened, that''s all that came out of my mouth.  Beautiful - what else can I say?', '2008-07-09 20:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
