(4815825, 697048, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the tones used - very effective fore the texture and the background.  The composition is a little static, but I still get the feeling of the barn looming over me - the point of view is excellent.</td>', 'I like the tones used - very effective fore the texture and the background.  The composition is a little static, but I still get the feeling of the barn looming over me - the point of view is excellent.', '2008-07-09 20:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
