(4818049, 696769, 29011, '<td valign="top">Ah, an interesting take. Worn by fire which is an element I would consider this weathered. But it''s hard to see the effect of weathered here.  (no vote)</td>', 'Ah, an interesting take. Worn by fire which is an element I would consider this weathered. But it''s hard to see the effect of weathered here.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818052, 696939, 29011, '<td valign="top">A very nice subject for the challenge. Good find indeed. It has good contrast and color and sharp where it should be. But I wonder if you could''ve found a more interesting viewpoint to share.  (no vote)</td>', 'A very nice subject for the challenge. Good find indeed. It has good contrast and color and sharp where it should be. But I wonder if you could''ve found a more interesting viewpoint to share.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818053, 696491, 29011, '<td valign="top">Cool find. I wish it was taken with a wider angle. I understand if equipment was the issue.  (no vote)</td>', 'Cool find. I wish it was taken with a wider angle. I understand if equipment was the issue.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818055, 694616, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful catch. Only wish the motion blur wasn''t an issue here. (no vote)</td>', 'Wonderful catch. Only wish the motion blur wasn''t an issue here. (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818056, 696906, 29011, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the statue''s somewhat weathered but wish we could see the effects of it. Overall, a nicely composed image. (no vote)</td>', 'I''m sure the statue''s somewhat weathered but wish we could see the effects of it. Overall, a nicely composed image. (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818058, 695882, 29011, '<td valign="top">A wonderful scene :)<br/>Though it seems a shot of weather itself rather than weathered. If we could see the rocky coast there, would consider this more attune to weathered. Still, congrats on getting the shot. (no vote)</td>', 'A wonderful scene :)Though it seems a shot of weather itself rather than weathered. If we could see the rocky coast there, would consider this more attune to weathered. Still, congrats on getting the shot. (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818059, 696209, 29011, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! Though some might see it more as weather itself , than weathered.  (no vote)</td>', 'Excellent capture! Though some might see it more as weather itself , than weathered.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818060, 695264, 29011, '<td valign="top">A good clean shot but perhaps a stretch for this challenge. Especially so for the young hands shown here. (no vote)</td>', 'A good clean shot but perhaps a stretch for this challenge. Especially so for the young hands shown here. (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818061, 696156, 29011, '<td valign="top">Really like the time of day you decided to go shoot this. The warm color and reflection really makes this special.  (no vote)</td>', 'Really like the time of day you decided to go shoot this. The warm color and reflection really makes this special.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818062, 695705, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s on topic alright. Shot looks heavily cropped. It has wonderful nuances of color and some texture. Needs more work in post processing to make it pop more to enchance clarity on the object. Color saturation looks good though. (no vote)</td>', 'It''s on topic alright. Shot looks heavily cropped. It has wonderful nuances of color and some texture. Needs more work in post processing to make it pop more to enchance clarity on the object. Color saturation looks good though. (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818064, 696809, 29011, '<td valign="top">It''s on topic considering the focus on the dead log. Not sure about the overall surrounding but it would''ve been nice to see more of it.  (no vote)</td>', 'It''s on topic considering the focus on the dead log. Not sure about the overall surrounding but it would''ve been nice to see more of it.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818066, 696678, 29011, '<td valign="top">A wonderful location :)<br/>Beautiful coursed sand shoreline. Only nitpick, top of the shot looks oversaturated.  (no vote)</td>', 'A wonderful location :)Beautiful coursed sand shoreline. Only nitpick, top of the shot looks oversaturated.  (no vote)', '2008-07-10 21:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
