(4819116, 697079, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nice find. Seems a tad oversaturated on my LCD at work. But I''ll say this does need more sharpening and perhaps lightened shadows and then contrast adjusted. (no vote)<br/> <br/>Update to my comment... Now looking from a proper CRT, the saturation looks perfect. Just wanted to let you know :) Needs just ever so slight contrast adjustments and tad of sharpening. Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Very nice find. Seems a tad oversaturated on my LCD at work. But I''ll say this does need more sharpening and perhaps lightened shadows and then contrast adjusted. (no vote) Update to my comment... Now looking from a proper CRT, the saturation looks perfect. Just wanted to let you know :) Needs just ever so slight contrast adjustments and tad of sharpening. Hope this does well for you.', '2008-07-11 12:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819182, 695885, 39057, '<td valign="top">"State of the Union"???  Let''s see...you have a digital camera...time to look over DPC challenges....time to find a torn up flag....time to upload to DPC...ON A COMPUTER with AN INTERNET CONNECTION.....<br/> <br/>...and your photo protrays the "State of the Union" as being "torn", "worn", or "tattered".... obviously the "State" is being good to you !<br/> <br/>...don''t make me laugh !</td>', '"State of the Union"???  Let''s see...you have a digital camera...time to look over DPC challenges....time to find a torn up flag....time to upload to DPC...ON A COMPUTER with AN INTERNET CONNECTION..... ...and your photo protrays the "State of the Union" as being "torn", "worn", or "tattered".... obviously the "State" is being good to you ! ...don''t make me laugh !', '2008-07-11 12:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
