(4820288, 697062, 59065, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, this went into my top 10 voting.  Great contrast between a brand new crisp clean card and old "weathered" worked hands.  There''s just something about this shot I like so I moved it up to the top.  Also, it''s an interesting shot because it''s a human weathered and there were only a few shots like that this time.  Most of the other shots were outdoor items, so something different counts for more in my voting.</td>', 'Love the shot, this went into my top 10 voting.  Great contrast between a brand new crisp clean card and old "weathered" worked hands.  There''s just something about this shot I like so I moved it up to the top.  Also, it''s an interesting shot because it''s a human weathered and there were only a few shots like that this time.  Most of the other shots were outdoor items, so something different counts for more in my voting.', '2008-07-12 01:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
