(4828332, 696654, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one did not come up for me in voting, but my impression is the perspective does not work. My eye is drawn up past the subject and instead, to the out of focus window in the background. Perhaps because that is where the strong color is. The statue having it''s face worn off may be a contributing factor to that as well.</td>', 'This one did not come up for me in voting, but my impression is the perspective does not work. My eye is drawn up past the subject and instead, to the out of focus window in the background. Perhaps because that is where the strong color is. The statue having it''s face worn off may be a contributing factor to that as well.', '2008-07-16 09:48:33.000000', NULL, 0),
