(4828426, 696636, 61961, '<td valign="top">I really liked this and thought it should have scored higher (I was one of your 8''s).  Good close framing and DOF.  I disagree that more color saturation is called for; the greenish cast is interesting but may have bothered some voters.  Very good subject for the challenge!</td>', 'I really liked this and thought it should have scored higher (I was one of your 8''s).  Good close framing and DOF.  I disagree that more color saturation is called for; the greenish cast is interesting but may have bothered some voters.  Very good subject for the challenge!', '2008-07-16 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828436, 696804, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought this should have placed higher as well.  Very good subject for the challenge, it''s a wonderful statue and I like your composition.  Excellent B&amp;W tones.  The cobweb is quite noticeable but I''m not sure that''s a bad thing, despite comments to the contrary.</td>', 'I thought this should have placed higher as well.  Very good subject for the challenge, it''s a wonderful statue and I like your composition.  Excellent B&W tones.  The cobweb is quite noticeable but I''m not sure that''s a bad thing, despite comments to the contrary.', '2008-07-16 10:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828442, 696666, 61961, '<td valign="top">I didn''t even get the irony of "aged" until reading your notes.  However, I really liked the various textures and thought this fit the theme well (I scored it an 8).  I also appreciate the unusual composition.  Welcome to DPC and keep up the good work.</td>', 'I didn''t even get the irony of "aged" until reading your notes.  However, I really liked the various textures and thought this fit the theme well (I scored it an 8).  I also appreciate the unusual composition.  Welcome to DPC and keep up the good work.', '2008-07-16 10:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828445, 697084, 70036, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  The leadling lines from the pier give this photo a strong perspective.    A great score for your very first DPC submission!   Keep up the great work and we hope to see lots more of you here in the Challenges.</td>', 'Excellent composition.  The leadling lines from the pier give this photo a strong perspective.    A great score for your very first DPC submission!   Keep up the great work and we hope to see lots more of you here in the Challenges.', '2008-07-16 10:34:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828456, 696654, 2764, '<td valign="top">You''ll always get a lower score when you submit a picture of a peice of artwork that is not yours, even if you present it in an interesting and dramatic way.  When the voter sees an image like this she/he thinks "But the sculptor did all the work" but when they see an old barn, they will attribute the "find" to the photographer.  Its a voter quirk thing that cost you that half a point, and always will.</td>', 'You''ll always get a lower score when you submit a picture of a peice of artwork that is not yours, even if you present it in an interesting and dramatic way.  When the voter sees an image like this she/he thinks "But the sculptor did all the work" but when they see an old barn, they will attribute the "find" to the photographer.  Its a voter quirk thing that cost you that half a point, and always will.', '2008-07-16 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828464, 697096, 2764, '<td valign="top">I like the nails but not the stuff they are stuck in.  It looks like it might be bread?</td>', 'I like the nails but not the stuff they are stuck in.  It looks like it might be bread?', '2008-07-16 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4828495, 695861, 47470, '<td valign="top">This should have placed much higher.  The composition is strange with so much room above his head (which is why I assume this placed so low), but I don''t think it would have worked nearly as well had you used traditional composition.  I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'This should have placed much higher.  The composition is strange with so much room above his head (which is why I assume this placed so low), but I don''t think it would have worked nearly as well had you used traditional composition.  I like this shot a lot.', '2008-07-16 10:47:42.000000', NULL, 0),
