(4829328, 696870, 28882, '<td valign="top">i love this.  i don''t know if it stands out as "weathered" but it is quite amazing.  Like a ghost from the past emerging.  Because it''s not a place that someone would normally be standing in like that, it makes the image look like a double exposure or an overlay.  Very cool indeed.  a fav.</td>', 'i love this.  i don''t know if it stands out as "weathered" but it is quite amazing.  Like a ghost from the past emerging.  Because it''s not a place that someone would normally be standing in like that, it makes the image look like a double exposure or an overlay.  Very cool indeed.  a fav.', '2008-07-16 16:01:04.000000', NULL, 0),
